Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5\fscx71\fscy71}Barcelona paid a FORTUNE for the\Nplayer who KNOCKED THEM OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:03.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Back in January
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:03.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}2018,
